        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86412, Modern Bezier Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFinally ready to make your kitchen a space you actually want to spend time in again? The Bezier Cabinet Pull is a fairly easy way to add chicness and style to one of the most used rooms in your home. This Modern Bezier Cabinet Handle is available in 3 sizes and some of the sleekest finish colors available. Each kitchen cabinet pull comes packaged beautifully with the installation hardware.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/bezier-cabinet-knob-emtek-86410\"><b>Bezier Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Bezier Cabinet Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86412-specifications.pdf?v=1704262413\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Bezier Cabinet Pull Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86412:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c.: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86413:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c.: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86414:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c.: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
